This boring work is finally over.
I am feeling very relieved now.
After such work, I always make tea for myself.
I go to the balcony with my hot tea.
It is still raining outside.
I video call my sister Sofia.
She is in Mexico.
She answers the phone immediately.
"Hi Maya!"
"How are you?" she asks, smiling.
"I am fine."
"I just finished a boring official task," I tell her.
Hearing this, Sofia laughs loudly.
"I also always put off such tasks," she says.
We both usually avoid such paperwork tasks.
In our family, such forms are always submitted late.
"But today I successfully updated my profile!" I say proudly.
"Wow!"
"You did a very big job!" Sofia says jokingly.
This is truly a very small victory.
But it is very satisfying.
We both laugh a lot about this.
I drink my tea and we chat for a long time.
